# gj jumps to the next sibling over an expanded block's children, and gk jumps back.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
		- Outline
		- Draft
	- Call client
	- Email boss
END
keys j gj gj x gk gk s
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @star
		- Outline
		- Draft
	- Call client
	- Email boss @done({today})
END
